import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 734 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Manghuang Ji Ning's Closure After Immortal Cultivation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 734 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Manghuang Ji Ning's Closure After Immortal Cultivation","no":734,"module":4,"tags":["Critique of Hang-Up Retirement","Manghuang Ji","Ji Ning","Energy Waste","Pseudo-Transcendence"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","17-Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards","701-Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0734_模块4-挂机养老批判-莽荒纪宁修仙后的封闭.md","filePath":"en/0734_模块4-挂机养老批判-莽荒纪宁修仙后的封闭.md"}`),a={name:"en/0734_模块4-挂机养老批判-莽荒纪宁修仙后的封闭.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,u,c){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-734-critique-of-hang-up-retirement-manghuang-ji-ning-s-closure-after-immortal-cultivation" tabindex="-1">Entry 734 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Manghuang Ji Ning&#39;s Closure After Immortal Cultivation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-734-critique-of-hang-up-retirement-manghuang-ji-ning-s-closure-after-immortal-cultivation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 734 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Manghuang Ji Ning&#39;s Closure After Immortal Cultivation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 17, 701</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-did-the-door-close-after-reaching-the-summit" tabindex="-1">Introduction: why did the door close after reaching the summit <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-did-the-door-close-after-reaching-the-summit" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: why did the door close after reaching the summit&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Manghuang Ji&#39;s protagonist Ji Ning cultivates from mortal to eternal peak, through innumerable life-and-death calamities, finally standing at the top of the Ji Ning Cosmos. By web-novel narrative inertia, reaching the summit is the endpoint — the story may close here, and readers are happy to see the protagonist&#39;s family reunited and carefree outside the world. But under the scrutiny of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, Ji Ning&#39;s choice after reaching the summit precisely constitutes the first typical sample of the &quot;hang-up-retirement strong one&quot;: <strong>power already overflowing the plane, yet he closes the door.</strong></p><p>Six top-level axioms must all be named here: the anti-predation axiom measures whether his power source is clean; the republican axiom of Myriad Races measures whether he remains open to all beings after reaching the summit; the collective ascension axiom measures whether he carries Myriad Ranks forward together; the causal self-discipline axiom measures whether his cross-plane operations are reported and controllable; the law-first axiom measures whether his &quot;closed-door retirement&quot; behavior is self-consistent and replicable at the law level. This entry uses these five rulers to measure Ji-Ning-style &quot;post-cultivation closure.&quot;</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-three-layer-structure-of-ji-ning-style-closure" tabindex="-1">I. The Three-Layer Structure of Ji-Ning-Style Closure <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-three-layer-structure-of-ji-ning-style-closure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Three-Layer Structure of Ji-Ning-Style Closure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ji Ning&#39;s choice after reaching the summit, opened up, has three layers of closure:</p><ol><li><strong>Spatial closure</strong>: bringing relatives and friends into a self-built eternal world, pulling away from the existing layer of all beings, no longer descending into the mortal world to feel suffering;</li><li><strong>Knowledge closure</strong>: his peak Dao, cultivation system, and understanding of laws no longer systematically open to lower-order beings, only passed within a small circle of relatives and friends;</li><li><strong>Responsibility closure</strong>: no longer taking public duties such as plane-level law calibration, historical-reversal prevention, and civilizational-engineering construction, as if &quot;beating the BOSS means getting off work.&quot;</li></ol><p>The three closures stacked essentially turn a Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm candidate who should have become a living anchor into a &quot;retired elder.&quot; Per the plane-transcendent strong one&#39;s four-dimensional assessment (Power 40 / Heart-Nature 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15), the Ji-Ning-style strong one&#39;s responsibility dimension is nearly zero — it is not that he cannot work, but that he chooses not to; not that he cannot, but that he feels &quot;it&#39;s time to rest.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-retire-after-success-does-not-hold-in-the-anchor-civilization" tabindex="-1">II. Why &quot;Retire After Success&quot; Does Not Hold in the Anchor Civilization <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-retire-after-success-does-not-hold-in-the-anchor-civilization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why &quot;Retire After Success&quot; Does Not Hold in the Anchor Civilization&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Old web novels exalt &quot;retire after success,&quot; as if a strong one&#39;s withdrawal is a virtue. But under Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law framework, this logic does not hold:</p><ul><li><strong>Power and responsibility are born together</strong>: an individual able to manipulate plane laws, his existence itself affects the local law network. Your not working does not mean you have no influence; your &quot;withdrawal&quot; itself is an active order vacuum, and the vacuum will be filled by predatory factions.</li><li><strong>The Myriad-Origin two-way cycle is irreversible</strong>: the strong one drew massive origin increments from the Myriad-Rank cycle to reach the summit; after reaching the summit, cutting off backflow is equal to opening a &quot;one-way-in&quot; spillway on the cycle chain. In the short term it is the strong one&#39;s personal choice; in the long term it is bloodletting the entire plane&#39;s origin cycle.</li><li><strong>Later-comers have no road</strong>: Ji Ning closes the Dao behind a door means the next potential Youth Supreme must re-step every pit he stepped, and may not even reach the height he once reached. This is not protection; this is knowledge monopolization.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-the-cost-of-closure-civilizational-weight-s-hidden-decay" tabindex="-1">III. The Cost of Closure: Civilizational Weight&#39;s Hidden Decay <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-cost-of-closure-civilizational-weight-s-hidden-decay" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Cost of Closure: Civilizational Weight&#39;s Hidden Decay&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou uses civilizational weight as the quantitative ruler to measure each high-order individual&#39;s actual contribution to civilization. Ji-Ning-style closure&#39;s cost is hidden:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Early Peak</th><th>After Eons of Closure</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Law-calibration frequency</td><td>Active inspection, real-time correction</td><td>Stalled drift, no one maintaining</td></tr><tr><td>Manual openness</td><td>System public at peak</td><td>Only passed to relatives/friends; outsiders have no door</td></tr><tr><td>Perception of lower-order beings</td><td>Deep among the people, feeling needs</td><td>Information fault, detached from beings</td></tr><tr><td>Civilizational-weight net</td><td>High</td><td>Continuously decaying toward zero</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The most fatal is not weight-zero itself, but the <strong>positional vacuum left after weight-zero</strong>. When the plane&#39;s mightiest existence chooses to close the door, predatory factions, separatist factions, and reincarnation-harvest factions within the plane seize the chance to fill this vacuum. The &quot;peace&quot; Ji Ning fought for all his life may, after he enters closed-door cultivation, be hollowed out in only a few thousand years — this is precisely the microscopic starting point of the &quot;hang-up-retirement and civilizational-reversal causal chain&quot; systematically argued in Entry 739.</p><h2 id="iv-heng-yuan-zhou-s-alternative-from-door-closer-to-living-anchor" tabindex="-1">IV. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alternative: From &quot;Door-closer&quot; to &quot;Living Anchor&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-heng-yuan-zhou-s-alternative-from-door-closer-to-living-anchor" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alternative: From &quot;Door-closer&quot; to &quot;Living Anchor&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If Ji Ning appeared in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, his path should be:</p><ol><li>After reaching the Origin Realm summit, not entering the &quot;eternal retirement world,&quot; but applying to enter the Multiverse Realm and participate in cross-plane engineering operations;</li><li>His peak Dao opened across the whole Selfless-Dao network; the parts of the 300-set Origin Cultivation System originally invented by him (advanced variants of the three base systems — Deduction-Iteration, Life-Cycle, Spatial-Law Dispatch) are freely available to Myriad Ranks;</li><li>Become a Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm living anchor, taking law-calibration duty for a star sector, under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision;</li><li>His wish for &quot;family reunion&quot; is not denied, but must be placed within the Myriad-Rank co-governance framework — family may accompany, but may not form a privileged stratum.</li></ol><p>In other words, Heng Yuan Zhou does not forbid strong ones from resting, but requires that the strong one&#39;s &quot;rest&quot; itself also be part of the civilizational increment: new manuals he deduces, new laws he weaves, new people he cultivates in the eternal world are all backfilled across the network through the Alaya Network, not locked in a private garden.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Ji Ning locking overflowing-plane computable power into a private garden is cosmos-grade energy waste; Heng Yuan Zhou requires every unit of high-order computable power be invested in civilizational increment</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Ji Ning&#39;s power source in the old system may be called clean, but his closure objectively vacates a vacuum for predatory factions, equal to disguised indulgence of predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-system strong ones reach the summit by gift, then lock later-comers out; Ji-Ning-style closure is actively closing the door after reaching the summit; the two results are the same — Myriad Ranks have no road</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the closed door is open only to relatives and friends; plant spirits, planet consciousnesses, and low-order aliens cannot even see a crack, directly violating the 99%-full-coverage commitment</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: peak Dao should have been open across the network; locking it into a private eternal world is hyper-multiverse-grade knowledge monopolization, touching the Selfless-Dao red line</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ji-Ning-style closure is not &quot;evil,&quot; but &quot;laziness&quot; — a spiritual slack after reaching the summit. But under the law-first axiom framework, spiritual slack is also a setting-level violation: it violates Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s iron law of &quot;power and responsibility born together.&quot; True transcendence is not beating the BOSS and closing the door to retire; it is, after beating the BOSS, opening a larger door, letting all Myriad Ranks walk in.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/701-超脱正统定义总论.html">Entry 701 · Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const m=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
